\par\par \b \uc2 Russian cbank buys $151 mln in Feb  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 203 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2013\par 13:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, March 7 (Reuters) - The \uc2 Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $119 million and 24.7 million euros ($32.1 million) in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in February, it said on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has made net foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases for the second month in a row, indicating that upward pressure on the rouble remained last month.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market when the rouble moves towards the top or bottom of a trading corridor, presently set at 31.65 to 38.65 against a euro-dollar basket. .\par \par \uc2 The scale of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  was nevertheless less than in January, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  acquired $596 million and 47.9 million euros.\par \par \uc2 The rouble was virtually unchanged over February, ending at 34.84 against the basket, having strengthened to 34.61 in mid-month. It has since weakened slightly to 34.96, near the mid-point of the trading corridor.\par \par \uc2 Recent \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have been much smaller than those seen during the first half of 2012, when the bank bought or sold billions of dollars each month amid volatile market conditions.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Jason Bush; Editing by Toby Chopra)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2 / | ABN | D | M   \par \par