\par\par \b \uc2 Russian c.bank buys $661 mln in January to tame rouble's firming\b0\par\par\uc2 214 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Februar 2013\par 12:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Feb 7 (Reuters) - The \uc2 Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $596 million and 47.9 million euros ($64.8 million) in January, it said on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market when the rouble moves towards the top or bottom of a trading corridor, presently set at 31.65 to 38.65 against a euro-dollar basket. .\par \par \uc2 This was the first month of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market since May 2012. In December, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stayed away from the market, with no transactions recorded.\par \par \uc2 In November, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $48.6 million and 4.2 million euros from its reserves to support the rouble.\par \par \uc2 The scale of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in January still does not compare to the first half of 2012 when the bank bought or sold billions of dollars each month amid volatile market conditions.\par \par \uc2 But the scope of last month's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicated that the rouble is on a firming track. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  now trades some 1.3 percent firmer against the dollar than at the beginning of the year, according to Reuters calculations. ($1 = 0.7387 euros)\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Lidia Kelly)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2 / | ABN | D | E | RBN | M   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020