\par\par \b \uc2 Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  To Refrain From  \highlight22\uc2 FX Interventions \highlight\uc2  In Evening Trade\b0\par\par\uc2 By Andrey Ostroukh   \par \uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Januar 2013\par 09:12\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW--\b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't carry out \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the Moscow exchange in the newly introduced evening trading session, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The Moscow exchange, formerly known as the Micex-RTS exchange, extended the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading session by four hours and 50 minutesstarting from Jan. 8. The bourse now trades the ruble, the euro and the dollar from 0600 GMT to 1950 GMT.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on its website it will "be present" at the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading session only from 0600 GMT to 1500 GMT, as before.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps the ruble within a band against the euro-dollar basket, comprised of 0.55 dollars and 0.45 euros, which market players say is now at RUB31.65-RUB38.65.\par \par \uc2 The bank buys foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the lower end of the band to prevent the ruble from excessively firming, and sells dollars and euros when the ruble closes in on the upper end of the corridor to limit its depreciation. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't carry out \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the middle of the trading band.\par \par \uc2 The ruble traded at RUB34.60 versus the basket by 0730 GMT Wednesday, losing some 0.4% on the day.\par \par \uc2 Write to Andrey Ostroukh at andrey.ostroukh@dowjones.com [ 09-01-13 0812GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130109e919000f2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
