 Russian bank VTB (VTBR.RS).\par \par \uc2 Write to Alexander Kolyandr at alexander.kolyandr@dowjones.com (Olga Razumovskaya contributed to the story.)\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 October 02, 2012 05:44 ET (09:44 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020121002e8a2001fw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
