\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ \uc2 Russia  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Widens Trading Band To RUB7 From RUB6 Vs Basket\b0\par\par\uc2 395 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juli 2012\par 17:16\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2012, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 24 Jul 2012 11:18 EDT *DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  CB Lowrs \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Threshold To $450M From $500M\par \par \uc2 24 Jul 2012 11:18 EDT *DJ  Ruble Band Now RUB31.65 To RUB38.65 Vs Dollar/Euro Basket\par \par \uc2 24 Jul 2012 11:19 EDT *DJ  Russian CB: Steps Will "Increase Potential Exchange Rate Flexibility"\par \par \uc2 24 Jul 2012 11:45 EDT DJ  \uc2 Russia \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Widens Trading Band To RUB7 From RUB6 Vs Basket\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Alexander Kolyander \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MOSCOW--\f28 \uc2 \f2 Russia's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  widened the ruble's trading band versus a basket of dollars and euros to a corridor of seven rubles from six rubles Tuesday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 It's the second shift in seven months.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The bank also lowered the amount of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  it will conduct before moving the corridor's boundaries, it said in a statement. It will now shift the corridor after buying or selling $450 million worth of foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The previous amount for a trading band shift was $500 million.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Bank of Russia manages the ruble in a trading band versus a basket of dollars and euros, buying foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  when the ruble strengthens, selling foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to support the ruble when it weakens, and doing nothing when the ruble is in the middle of the band.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Raising the potential flexibility of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  exchange rate through these changes will help the effectiveness of the interest rate policy used by the Bank of Russia to maintain price stability," the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The last time the bank acted was in December, widening the corridor by a ruble and lowering the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  volume by $100 million.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Alexander Kolyandr at alexander.kolyandr@dowjones.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Corrections & Amplifications\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This item was corrected at 15:58 GMT to show that the Russian trading band is measured in rubles. The first paragraph misstated that it was in euros.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Subscribe to WSJ: \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires }}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 24 Jul 2012 11:57 EDT DJ \par Correction to Story on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Russia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Widening Ruble Trading Band\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "\f28 \uc2 \f2 Russia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Widens Trading Band To RUB7 From RUB6 Vs Basket" at 1545 GMT misstated the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the first paragraph as euros instead of rubles.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Subscribe to WSJ: \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires }}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 July 24, 2012 11:57 ET (15:57 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020120724e87o004tx\par