\par\par \b \uc2 Russian  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Halts  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\uc2  As Ruble Strengthens\b0\par\par\uc2 By Ira Iosebashvili   \par \uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Juni 2012\par 14:01\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not carry out foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on June 8 to support the ruble, the first time it didn't act in more than two weeks, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  manages the ruble in a six-ruble-wide band against the basket, purchasing dollars and euros when the ruble appreciates to upper limit of the corridor, and selling \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the ruble approaches the band's lower edge. The band currently ranges from 32.15 rubles ($0.98) to RUB38.15.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold almost $1 billion to support the ruble between May 25 and June 7, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened against the basket of euros and dollars the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses as a broad gauge of the ruble's strength.\par \par \uc2 The volume of its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  peaked June 4 t $207 million and tapered to $70 million June 7, the data showed.\par \par \uc2 The ruble fell by nearly 14% against the dollar in May on lower oil and euro zone woes to a low of RUB34.14, its weakest in more than three years, before rebounding with the help of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As of 11:33 GMT, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded at RUB32.61 against the dollar, stronger by 0.2%, and RUB36.33 against the basket, also a 0.2% gain.\par \par \uc2 -Write to Ira Iosebashvili at ira.iosebashvili@dowjones.com [ 13-06-12 1201GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120613e86d000rx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
