\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ Russia Ctrl Banker: Ruble Plunge Caused Solely By European Crisis - Interfax\b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Juni 2012\par 13:53\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2012, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 1 Jun 2012 07:55 EDT *DJ  Russia Ctrl Banker: Policy Remains Unchanged, Despite RUB Weakness - Interfax\par \par \uc2 1 Jun 2012 07:56 EDT *DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bank Head: \b \highlight22\uc2 FX Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  Already "Quite Intensive" - Report\par \par \uc2 1 Jun 2012 07:58 EDT *DJ  Russia Ctrl Bank Head: RUB Decline Will Slow, Despite Falling Oil\par \par \uc2 1 Jun 2012 08:35 EDT DJ  Ruble Drop To Slow, Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chief Says - Interfax\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW (Dow Jones)--The Russian ruble's decline will slow, despite the drop in oil prices to below $100 per barrel, \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chairman Sergei Ignatyev said Friday, according Interfax news agency.\par \par \uc2 Ignatyev defended the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, saying its purchases of the ruble have been "quite intensive." Some market participants say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not done enough to stop the ruble's depreciation in recent days.\par \par \uc2 Ignatyev also told Interfax recent ruble weakness, which saw Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  give up about 12% of its value versus the dollar in May, has been caused by Europe's sovereign debt crisis, rather than domestic factors.\par \par \uc2 "That which is occurring on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market here has only one cause, and that is the situation in Europe," Ignatyev said. "Unfortunately, the situation in Europe is worsening and so far European politicians have not offered the market a program for combat ting these difficulties."\par \par \uc2 -By Ira Iosebashvili, Dow Jones Newswires, 7 495 232 9192;\par \par \uc2 (MORE TO FOLLOW) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 01, 2012 08:35 ET (12:35 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020120601e86100348\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
