\par\par \b \uc2 MARKET TALK: Crisis Gives Russia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Respite -\uc2 Commerzbank\b0\par\par\uc2 139 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Mai 2012\par 11:28\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 0928 GMT [Dow Jones] The crisis is giving Russia \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  respite, says \uc2 Commerzbank\uc2 , as RUB is sliding all by itself, stemming the need for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken it. \uc2 Commerzbank\uc2  says \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  says all the right things about seeking a "free floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  soon," but "\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  data published by the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly point to the opposite; as soon as RUB appreciation gains traction, Bank Rossii is active on the lower side of Basket/RUB buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  even though the lower boundary of the RUB corridor is far from being reached." Now it can sit back and relax, though. (laura.clarke@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par Markettalk.eu@dowjones.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 [ 17-05-12 0928GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1085   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120517e85h000kl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
