\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Russia cbank: no need to change monetary policy\b0\par\par\uc2 335 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 November 2011\par 12:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Cbank sees no need to change rates in November\par \par \uc2 * May change \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  parameters\par \par \uc2 * Says net purchases of dollars and euros so far at $16 bln\par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes, detail)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Nov 2 (Reuters) - Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sees no need to change the level of its key interest rates this month, although it may loosen its grip on the rouble rate by changing \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy in the near future, the deputy chairman said on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  put key interest rates on hold last week, indicating that current rate levels balance inflationary risks and risks to the sustainability of economic growth.\par \par \uc2 It will next meet on monetary policy at the end of November.\par \par \uc2 "We do not see a necessity to change interest rates," Sergei Shvetsov told journalists after a briefing at the Duma, the lower house of the parliament, referring to this month's meeting.\par \par \uc2 Shvetsov also said that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy could be changed in coming months.\par \par \uc2 "We plan to carry out less \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  (next year). Our presence on the market will be decreasing," he said, adding that there was a chance that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could widen the rouble's trading band before the end of this year but this was not very likely.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps the rouble within a floating band against the euro-dollar basket , which now stands at 32.70-37.70, and sells foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the rouble in the upper range of the band.\par \par \uc2 It does not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the middle range of the corridor and starts buying dollars and euros when the rouble firms towards the lower boundary.\par \par \uc2 In the first 10 months of 2011 the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's net purchases in \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is a positive difference between the buying and selling of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , totaled $16 billion, Shvetsov said.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Andrey Ostroukh and Oksana Kobzeva; Editing by Lidia Kelly/Anna Willard)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -C.BANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2   (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020111102e7b2000rn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
