s                    3.4       3.1       3.8       5.4        6.1\par                                                                                \par \par  \par \par \par  \par \par                                                         For the year           \par                                                      ended 31 December         \par                                                                                \par                                               2006   2007   2008   2009   2010 \par                                                                                \par                                                (% of total expenditure net of  \par                                                             UST)               \par                                                                                \par Debt service                                    4.4    2.6    2.2    1.9    1.9\par                                                                                \par Of which                                                                       \par                                                                                \par Domestic debt service                           1.2    1.2    1.2    1.0    1.2\par                                                                                \par Foreign debt service                            3.1    1.4    1.0    1.0    0.7\par                                                                                \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Non-interest expenditure net of UST(2) 95.6 97.4 97.8 98.1 98.1\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2                                                                                \par State administration                            9.1   12.1    9.7    7.4    6.7\par                                                                                \par Law and order                                  13.9   11.9   11.8   11.0   10.8\par                             