\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Russia buys $3.6 bln to curb rouble rise in April\b0\par\par\uc2 325 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Mai 2011\par 10:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * C.bank buys $3.3 bln and 261 mln eur in April\par \par \uc2 * Rouble driven by high oil price to highest since 2008\par \par \uc2 * Firms 3.8 pct vs dlr, 1.3 pct vs basket in April\par \par \uc2 * Rouble's floating corridor may not have moved\par \par \uc2 * Level of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower than March, Feb\par \par \uc2 (Adds detail)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, May 11 (Reuters) - Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it bought $3.28 billion and 260.9 million euros ($364.5 million) in April to keep in check a rouble driven by high oil prices to its strongest levels since 2008.\par \par \uc2 'Target' purchases -- subject to preset daily limits based on factors such as the oil price and budget balance forecasts -- totalled $3.0 billion and 239.9 million euros, data from the bank showed on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The remaining $282 million and 21 million euros were thus registered as 'accumulated' \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps the rouble within a floating corridor versus a euro-dollar basket <RUS=MCX>, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying dollars and euros in the lower part of the band, selling foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the upper part and doing nothing in the middle.\par \par \uc2 The corridor is moved by 5 kopecks once the amount of accumulated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  tops $600 million, reflecting market trends and matching the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's intention to move towards a free float.\par \par \uc2 The reported volume of April accumulated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  suggests the floating corridor may not have been moved from 32.35-37.35 roubles per basket.\par \par \uc2 Boosted by oil prices holding above $110 per barrel [O/R], the rouble strengthened 3.79 percent versus the dollar <RUB=> and added 1.3 percent versus the basket last month.\par \par \uc2 The bank's overall level of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, decreased in April from $5.4 bln in March and $4.6 bln in February.\par \par \uc2 (Writing by Andrey Ostroukh; Editing by Lidia Kelly, John Stonestreet)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110511e75b000xi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
