\par\par \b \uc2 Bank Of  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  Buys $5.4B Equivalent In Mar  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 April 2011\par 17:36\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchased $4.49 billion and EUR600 million in March to slow the strengthening ruble, as surging oil prices drove the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to its strongest levels in two and a half years, data from the regulator showed Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The data was in line with the figure quoted by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Sergei Ignatyev this week.\par \par \uc2 Target purchases, which are determined by factors such as oil price dynamics and budget flows, totalled $3.4 billion and EUR400 million, the data showed.\par \par \uc2 The rest of the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , registered as "accumulated" \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , are intended to smooth out volatility in the ruble and amounted to $1.2 billion and $200 million euros.\par \par \uc2 The Bank of Russia manages its ruble inside a floating corridor against a basket of dollars and euros, moving the borders of the trading band by five kopecks for every $600 million it buys or sells.\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the trading band may have been moved twice, to a level of 32.35-37.35 against the basket compared with 32.45-37.45 as of March 1.\par \par \uc2 The ruble closed Thursday at 33.69 against the basket, unchanged on the day.\par \par \uc2 The ruble strengthened by 0.1% against the basket and 1.3% against the dollar in March, as the price for oil hovered above $110 a barrel.\par \par \uc2 -By Ira Iosebashvili, Dow Jones Newswires; +7 495 232 9195; ira.iosebashvili@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -0- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 07-04-11 1536GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020110407e7470015y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
